This repository contains no syd source code. syd is a separate program
(https://gitlab.exherbo.org/sydbox/sydbox), licensed GPL-3.0-only, invoked as a
child process. Upstream maintainers: Ali Polatel, Morgane Glidic.

syd binary releases are distributed from https://distfiles.exherbo.org/sydbox/
and signed by the minisign key b1e47bc29cc65132 (contact: syd@chesswob.org),
whose serialized public key is served by the upstream repository at
https://gitlab.exherbo.org/sydbox/sydbox/-/raw/main/dev/syd-release.pub.
Verification is minisign, not OpenPGP: the 0x25F201EDF60FF478 key served at
https://distfiles.exherbo.org/sydbox/syd.asc is not the signer (syd.lock notes).
